Z||000000||crypto1079||11-10-2001||10:53 AM||||I'm going to try to ask this list for the first time..  i CANNOT get my 3.4 running right.  It's from a '95 camaro.  I had my heads and intake ported/polished, using 302 injectors/adj. fuel pressure regulator and high flow pump.  New intake gaskets/egr tube/valve, vacuum lines (steel), o2 sensor, iac valve, pcv, fuel filter, air charge sensor, cool. temp sensor, just about everything I can think of I replaced.  Runs rough, EXHAUST MANIFOLDS glow, get lean code every once in awhile, IDLES AND RUNS WAY TOO HIGH RPMS, but get's better when warm (warm runs kinda smooth but idles at 1500).  IS MY OLD2.8 COMPUTER CAPABLE OF HANDLING THIS SETUP?  Thanks.<BR>Greg 86GT 3.4 auto||||reg||13
Z||000001||avengador1||11-10-2001||11:11 AM||||Im not sure about the computer, but it sounds like you have a vacuum leak.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Avendgador1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
